<!-- RPA — recombinasa, cadena desplazada, síntesis nueva a 37°C -->
<div class="wrapper">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 280 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Animación RPA">

    <!-- Temperature badge -->
    <rect x="8" y="4" width="52" height="16" rx="5" fill="rgba(57,255,20,0.1)" stroke="rgba(57,255,20,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="34" y="15" fill="#39ff14" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">37°C cte.</text>

    <!-- Technique badge -->
    <rect x="220" y="4" width="52" height="16" rx="5" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.1)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.4)" stroke-width="0.8" />
    <text x="246" y="15" fill="#00e5ff" font-size="8" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">RPA</text>

    <!-- dsDNA — phase 1 -->
    <line x1="30" y1="65" x2="110" y2="65" stroke="#00e5ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" class="ds-top" />
    <line x1="30" y1="80" x2="110" y2="80" stroke="#b388ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" class="ds-bot" />
    <!-- Ladder rungs (hydrogen bonds) -->
    {[45, 60, 75, 90].map((x) => (
      <line x1={x} y1="65" x2={x} y2="80" stroke="#1e3a5f" stroke-width="1.5" class="rung" />
    ))}
    <!-- Label dsDNA -->
    <text x="60" y="60" fill="#64748b" font-size="6.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="label-ds">dsDNA original</text>

    <!-- Recombinase proteins — phase 2 -->
    <circle cx="110" cy="62" r="8" fill="rgba(255,179,0,0.2)" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1.5" class="rec-1" />
    <circle cx="110" cy="83" r="8" fill="rgba(255,179,0,0.2)" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="1.5" class="rec-2" />
    <text x="110" y="66" fill="#ffb300" font-size="6" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="rec-1">R</text>
    <text x="110" y="87" fill="#ffb300" font-size="6" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="rec-2">R</text>

    <!-- Displaced strand — phase 3 -->
    <path d="M 110,65 Q 140,50 160,55 Q 180,60 200,58"
      stroke="#00e5ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" fill="none" class="displaced" />
    <text x="155" y="47" fill="#00e5ff" font-size="6.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="label-disp">cadena desplazada</text>

    <!-- New strand synthesis — phase 4 -->
    <line x1="110" y1="80" x2="200" y2="80" stroke="#39ff14" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" class="new-strand" />
    <rect x="186" y="72" width="18" height="16" rx="5" fill="rgba(57,255,20,0.18)" stroke="#39ff14" stroke-width="1.2" class="polymerase" />
    <text x="195" y="82" fill="#39ff14" font-size="6" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="polymerase">Pol</text>
    <path d="M 205,80 L 215,80 L 211,76 M 215,80 L 211,84"
      stroke="#39ff14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" class="pol-arrow" />
    <text x="155" y="97" fill="#39ff14" font-size="6.5" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="label-new">nueva cadena</text>

    <!-- Bottom note — phase 4 -->
    <text x="140" y="150" fill="#64748b" font-size="7" font-family="monospace" text-anchor="middle" class="bottom-note">sin termociclador · ~20 min · temperatura corporal</text>
  </svg>

  <!-- Leyenda estática -->
  <div class="legend">
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#00e5ff"></span>línea doble = dsDNA cerrado</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldot" style="background:rgba(255,179,0,0.5);border:1px solid #ffb300"></span><strong style="color:#ffb300">R</strong> = proteína recombinasa (invade sin calor)</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="ldash" style="border-color:#00e5ff"></span>discontinua = cadena simple desplazada</span>
    <span class="leg"><span class="lbar" style="background:#39ff14"></span>verde = nueva cadena sintetizada</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Pasos sincronizados (loop 12s, 4 fases de 3s) -->
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step s1">
      <span class="snum">1/4</span>
      <p>ADN diana a <strong>37°C</strong> — temperatura corporal. Sin termociclador: la reacción funciona con batería o calor corporal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s2">
      <span class="snum">2/4</span>
      <p>Proteínas <strong>recombinasa (R)</strong> se ensamblan sobre los primers e invaden la doble cadena en el sitio diana específico.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s3">
      <span class="snum">3/4</span>
      <p>Una cadena queda <strong>desplazada</strong> (línea discontinua). La proteína SSB estabiliza la cadena libre expuesta como molde.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step s4">
      <span class="snum">4/4</span>
      <p>La <strong>polimerasa (Pol)</strong> sintetiza la nueva cadena complementaria. Amplificación completa en ~20 minutos a temperatura ambiente.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wrapper { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  svg { width: 100%; }

  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px;
    padding: 4px 7px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .lbar { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 2px; border-radius: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldash { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 0; border-top: 2px dashed; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ldot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  .steps { position: relative; height: 5rem; }
  .step {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    background: rgba(57,255,20,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57,255,20,0.12);
    border-radius: 5px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .snum {
    font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: #39ff14; flex-shrink: 0;
    font-weight: bold; padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .step p { font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.42; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0; }
  .step strong { color: #39ff14; font-weight: 600; }

  /* SVG — 12s loop, 4 fases de 3s (25% cada una) */
  .ds-top, .ds-bot {
    stroke-dasharray: 85; stroke-dashoffset: 85;
    animation: rpa-ds 12s ease infinite;
  }
  .ds-bot { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .rung   { animation: rpa-rung 12s ease infinite; }
  .label-ds { animation: rpa-phase1 12s ease infinite; }

  .rec-1, .rec-2 { animation: rpa-rec 12s ease infinite; }
  .rec-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }

  .displaced  { stroke-dasharray: 120; stroke-dashoffset: 120; animation: rpa-displaced 12s ease infinite; }
  .label-disp { animation: rpa-phase3 12s ease infinite; }

  .new-strand { stroke-dasharray: 95; stroke-dashoffset: 95; animation: rpa-newstrand 12s ease infinite; }
  .polymerase { animation: rpa-phase4 12s ease infinite; }
  .pol-arrow  { animation: rpa-phase4 12s ease infinite; }
  .label-new  { animation: rpa-phase4 12s ease infinite; }
  .bottom-note { animation: rpa-phase4 12s ease infinite; }

  @keyframes rpa-ds {
    0%     { stroke-dashoffset: 85; opacity: 0; }
    2%     { opacity: 1; }
    8%     { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%    { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 1; }
    100%   { stroke-dashoffset: 85; opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-rung {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    10%    { opacity: 1; }
    96%    { opacity: 1; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-phase1 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    8%     { opacity: 1; }
    24%    { opacity: 1; }
    25%    { opacity: 0; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-rec {
    0%     { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.5); }
    25%    { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.5); }
    30%    { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    74%    { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    75%    { opacity: 0; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-displaced {
    0%     { stroke-dashoffset: 120; }
    50%    { stroke-dashoffset: 120; }
    62%    { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%    { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100%   { stroke-dashoffset: 120; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-phase3 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    50%    { opacity: 0; }
    55%    { opacity: 0.7; }
    74%    { opacity: 0.7; }
    75%    { opacity: 0; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-newstrand {
    0%     { stroke-dashoffset: 95; }
    75%    { stroke-dashoffset: 95; }
    86%    { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    96%    { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100%   { stroke-dashoffset: 95; }
  }
  @keyframes rpa-phase4 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    75%    { opacity: 0; }
    80%    { opacity: 1; }
    96%    { opacity: 1; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Pasos de texto — 12s loop, 4 × 25% */
  @keyframes s1 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    3%     { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    22%    { opacity: 1; }
    25%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s2 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    25%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    28%    { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    47%    { opacity: 1; }
    50%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s3 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    50%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    53%    { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    72%    { opacity: 1; }
    75%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    100%   { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes s4 {
    0%     { opacity: 0; }
    75%    { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
    78%    { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    96%    { opacity: 1; }
    100%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  }
  .s1 { animation: s1 12s ease infinite; }
  .s2 { animation: s2 12s ease infinite; }
  .s3 { animation: s3 12s ease infinite; }
  .s4 { animation: s4 12s ease infinite; }
</style>
